# Public client-side configuration for razors-edge-web.
#
# razors-edge is web-only with a fully mocked, in-memory booking flow
# (ADR-001 / ADR-003) — there is NO backend and NO network at runtime,
# so there is effectively nothing required here. The single optional
# variable below only sets the canonical origin used by Next's
# `metadataBase` (Open Graph / canonical URLs). Unset, it falls back to
# the local dev origin.
#
# Never commit a real `.env` (CLAUDE.md § 4) — this `.env.example` is
# the only committed env file.

# Canonical site origin for absolute OG / canonical URLs. Set this to
# the deployed demo URL in production.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3070
